  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving equitable and sustainable access to an integrated package of critical services for children in northern Togo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the needs of children, including displaced children and host communities, through a humanitarian- development-peace nexus approach to strengthen social services and cohesion in the regions in the north of Togo affected by the spillover of the Sahel crisis2029&#xB144;&#xAE4C;&#xC9C0; &#xD1A0;&#xACE0;&#xC758; &#xC0AC;&#xBC18;&#xACFC; &#xCE74;&#xB77C; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC758; &#xC544;&#xB3D9; &#xBC0F; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144;, &#xD2B9;&#xD788; &#xC18C;&#xB140;&#xB4E4;&#xC5D0;&#xAC8C; &#xC591;&#xC9C8;&#xC758; &#xAD50;&#xC721;, &#xBCF4;&#xAC74;, &#xBCF4;&#xD638; &#xBC0F; &#xC2DD;&#xC218;&#xC704;&#xC0DD; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4;&#xC758; &#xD1B5;&#xD569; &#xD328;&#xD0A4;&#xC9C0;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xC131; &#xC81C;&#xACE0;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the improvement of health system in the communities, the establishment of a clean and healthy environment, the improvement of academic performance and the improvement of access to quality education for vulnerable children and adolescents, including girls and children with disabilities</narrative>
  </description>
